{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "latam", "appid": 548430, "month": "2024-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1729036800, "end_date": 1729727999, "month_true_total": 27, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:35:35 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "177593425", "author": {"steamid": "76561198330359824", "personaname": "Tacos de Patas :P", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198330359824/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 19991, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19813, "last_played": 1785864645, "avatar": "8da987da6ddaafbf0d8eb5938aef8e2fbf63c89f"}, "language": "latam", "review": "si, todavia si", "timestamp_created": 1729700963, "timestamp_updated": 1764091526, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177350699", "author": {"steamid": "76561198331867717", "personaname": "Pan Humedo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198331867717/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3507, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3126, "last_played": 1730155749, "avatar": "bfbfd6865670be5bab6d4837420c247473a45395"}, "language": "latam", "review": "\nROCK AND STONE!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1729360934, "timestamp_updated": 1729360934, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177313279", "author": {"steamid": "76561198074823343", "personaname": "Cibet", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198074823343/", "num_games_owned": 78, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 11350, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6772, "last_played": 1770164710, "avatar": "a627d3c0e9fe310d6ce9538c3594376522acbb00"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Emborracharte hasta desmayarse o ir borracho al trabajo, jugar flappy bird, barril-ball ([i]sí las pelotas son barriles[/i]), prop hunt, disco-ball ([i]sí, la pelota es una bola disco[/i]); vestir a los enanos, bailar... Todo lo anterior mientras no paras de escuchar [i]y gritar tu también[/i] \"Rock-n-Stone!\", asegurándose de molestar al baboso del centro de mando ([i]ctm wey que nomas se la pasa sentado[/i]). Este juego es increíble incluso si lo juegas solo, aunque con amigos se disfruta más.\n \nEstaría bien que añadan un modo en el que puedas ir al planeta que ves a lo lejos y, tal vez,  [u]minar sus minerales. [/u] Y ya para agregarle un toque de sobrevivencia, que haya enemigos, pero que no sean los típicos enemigos como zombies u otros enanos, debería ser algo a lo que se le tenga terror o asco... [u]como  arañas tal vez. [/u] \n\n100/10", "timestamp_created": 1729316274, "timestamp_updated": 1729316439, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177184432", "author": {"steamid": "76561198330951623", "personaname": "Arkhawk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ArkhawkGames/", "num_games_owned": 522, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 23040, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 32, "playtime_at_review": 19235, "last_played": 1787630845, "avatar": "3f21b8bc409812ac01af40d5681ea78f72eec65f"}, "language": "latam", "review": "En geología se denomina roca a cada uno de los diversos materiales sólidos, formados por cristales o granos de uno o más minerales.1​ En la Tierra, la corteza está formada por rocas, al igual que las partes equivalentes de otros cuerpos planetarios similares.2​ En un sentido más concreto, se llama roca a cualquier material constituido como un agregado natural de uno o más minerales o de otros materiales, entendiendo por agregado, un sólido cohesionado. El estudio de las rocas se denomina petrología.\n\nEn pocas palabras: ROCK AND STONE!!!", "timestamp_created": 1729126126, "timestamp_updated": 1732735976, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177183095", "author": {"steamid": "76561198255173266", "personaname": "Matonick", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198255173266/", "num_games_owned": 472, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 3027, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2372, "last_played": 1762573785, "avatar": "76f0563e0032842f9afedca68093bdbe384dc6dd"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Roca y piedra", "timestamp_created": 1729123734, "timestamp_updated": 1729123734, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}